{"id":436,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Floats using a mysterious energy. The pattern engraved upon its back is held as sacred and can sometimes be found in imagery from ancient cemeteries and other such timeworn places."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Polishing Bronzor to a shine makes its surface reflect the truth, according to common lore. Be that as it may, Bronzor hates being polished."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It appears in ancient ruins. The pattern on its body doesn’t come from any culture in the Galar region, so it remains shrouded in mystery."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"Implements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Ancient people believed that the pattern on Bronzor’s back contained a mysterious power."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"They are found in ancient tombs. The patterns on their backs are said to be imbued with mysterious power."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"X-ray photos were taken to check its body structure. Nothing appeared, however."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."},{"name":"Heatproof","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's heatproof body halves the damage taken from Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Heavy Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Doubles the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":436,"name":"Bronzor","condition":null,"children":[{"id":437,"name":"Bronzong","condition":"Lv. 33","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,93],[4,109],[8,371],[12,286],[16